Data Content: A7 69 69 79 D6 46 D9 AC EC 74 CB 1C 13 B6 8E 82 B5 FC F3 64 4C 44 54 81 58 5F B4 69 E0 55 C8 17
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
